{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26164","headline":"鱼上冰 · 吴晃","name":"鱼上冰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春水潜鳞发，寒潭旧藻疎。\n扬鬐顺气後，振鬣上冰初。\n戏广怜空洁，浮清媚景虚。\n戒贪还避饵，思达每怀书。\n湿映流澌薄，狂游触浪余。\n终希泮涣泽，爲化北溟鱼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴晃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26164.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26164","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}